# Worlds Within Worlds: each player "may put any number of creature cards from their hand onto the battlefield". Bot1 puts none
# of its Hill Giant (it stays in hand) while Bot2 puts two of its three creature cards (Serra Angel and Grizzly Bears, but not
# Hill Giant). The two Spirit tokens Bot1 made were exiled and ceased to exist (CR 111.7, 400.7), so only the Savannah Lions
# goes to a hand; the spell ends in exile.

